OL,5,G1445 Opening Lines
OL,6,     FThe series that takes a look at
OL,7,     Fbooks, plays and stories and how
OL,8,     Fthey work. John Yorke examines The
OL,9,     FThings They Carried, Tim O'Brien's
OL,10,     Fstories on war and memory set in
OL,11,     FVietnam.
OL,12,G1500 The Things They Carried
OL,13,     F1/2. A young conscript joins Alpha
OL,14,     FCompany in Vietnam in 1969. Their
OL,15,     Faim? To survive. If they can.
OL,16,     FThese are the stories of those who
OL,17,     Fdid.
