OL,6,     FThe award-winning Scottish writer
OL,7,     FIrvine Welsh speaks to Bookclub,
OL,8,     Fpresented by James Naughtie, about
OL,9,     Fhis era-defining 1993 debut novel,
OL,10,     FTrainspotting.
