OL,5,G1915 The Power of the Bayeux Tapestry
OL,6,     FExploring why the Bayeux Tapestry
OL,7,     Fis a deeply political object, from
OL,8,     Fits creation in the 11th century
OL,9,     Fto its triumphant long-awaited
OL,10,     Farrival in the UK.
OL,11,G1945 Just One Thing
OL,12,     FMichael reveals how slowing your
OL,13,     Fmealtimes and savouring the
OL,14,     Fflavours could help you stay full
OL,15,     Ffor longer, cut down your snacking
OL,16,     Fand even reduce your blood sugar
OL,17,     Flevels.
